{"id":"341dd891eed2b080","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-herbrand-expansion.md","title":"Herbrand Expansion","display":"df-herbrand-expansion — Herbrand Expansion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-herbrand-expansion","aliases":["57-df-herbrand-expansion"],"display":"df-herbrand-expansion — Herbrand Expansion","depends_on":["[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","[[57-df-substitution-formula]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-subformula]]","[[57-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-herbrand-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-herbrand-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-herbrand-expansion — Herbrand Expansion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"237ed61a00bb9297\" href=\"?note=237ed61a00bb9297\" title=\"57-df-substitution-formula\">57-df-substitution-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" href=\"?note=c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" title=\"57-df-subformula\">57-df-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为一阶字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{QFree}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sf}\\)</span> 与替换分别见依赖文件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\)</span> 是互异变量的有限列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge0\">\\(n\\ge0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 无量词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\psi\">\\(\\varphi=\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\psi\\)</span>。长度零的前缀为空前缀；矩阵无量词保证最大前导全称块的分解唯一。多项替换按从左到右迭代；被代入的项均闭合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(T)\">\\(E(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFree}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}^0_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}^0_S\\)</span> 是本文件补齐的接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\psi:n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ i\\ne j\\Rightarrow x_i\\ne x_j,\\ \\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi),\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\},\\\\\n\\forall\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S,\\qquad\\mathrm{Term}^0_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{HU}(S),\\\\\nE(\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\psi[t_1/x_1]\\cdots[t_n/x_n]:(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)^n\\},\\\\\nE(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in T}E(\\sigma)\\quad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\theta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\neg\\exists s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(s\\doteq t\\in\\mathrm{Sf}(\\theta)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\psi:n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ i\\ne j\\Rightarrow x_i\\ne x_j,\\ \\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi),\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\},\\\\\n\\forall\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S,\\qquad\\mathrm{Term}^0_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{HU}(S),\\\\\nE(\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\psi[t_1/x_1]\\cdots[t_n/x_n]:(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)^n\\},\\\\\nE(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in T}E(\\sigma)\\quad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\theta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\neg\\exists s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(s\\doteq t\\in\\mathrm{Sf}(\\theta)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>E 的对象仍为原全称句子的全部基实例；不把 Herbrand 基中的正原子集合冒充实例集合。HU 为空时定义仍成立，但相关模型等价定理另要求非空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"237ed61a00bb9297","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-quantifier-free","status":"resolved","id":"6e2653d41c62cb0e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"c503c7cd3e5d57d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HU}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge0","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi=\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"E(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}^0_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S&\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\psi:n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ i\\ne j\\Rightarrow x_i\\ne x_j,\\ \\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi),\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\},\\\\\n\\forall\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S,\\qquad\\mathrm{Term}^0_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{HU}(S),\\\\\nE(\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\psi)&\\coloneqq\\{\\psi[t_1/x_1]\\cdots[t_n/x_n]:(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)^n\\},\\\\\nE(T)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in T}E(\\sigma)\\quad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\theta)&\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\neg\\exists s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(s\\doteq t\\in\\mathrm{Sf}(\\theta)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1954,"backlinks":[{"id":"c00621aad56d26fb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S$，$\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing$，见 [[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)$ 为互异变量列；$\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)$，$\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}$。$\\varphi=\\exists x_1\\cdots\\exists x_n\\psi$，且 $\\Phi\\models\\varphi$。有限非空析取按从左到右加括号。"},{"id":"8f8f1ec72ff6ac85","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为一阶字母表，$\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing$。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S$ 且 $\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\varphi)$；$E$、$\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S$、$\\mathrm{EqFree}$ 取 [[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]。$\\mathrm{Sat}$ 与 $\\mathrm{PropSat}$ 分别取一阶非空结构满足性和原子任意布尔赋值满足性；基实例无量词且闭合。 $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S$ 且 $\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\sigma)$。"},{"id":"d7c14afe5ff8ba89","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为一阶字母表，$\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing$。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S$ 且 $\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\varphi)$；$E$、$\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S$、$\\mathrm{EqFree}$ 取 [[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]。$\\mathrm{Sat}$ 与 $\\mathrm{PropSat}$ 分别取一阶非空结构满足性和原子任意布尔赋值满足性；基实例无量词且闭合。"},{"id":"833b88857256645e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为一阶字母表，$\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing$。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S$ 且 $\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\varphi)$；$E$、$\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S$、$\\mathrm{EqFree}$ 取 [[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]。$\\mathrm{Sat}$ 与 $\\mathrm{PropSat}$ 分别取一阶非空结构满足性和原子任意布尔赋值满足性；基实例无量词且闭合。"},{"id":"3559f03aaa45d061","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为一阶字母表；$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S$。子结构、满足、逻辑等价见依赖文件；$\\forall\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 取 [[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]。$\\mathrm{SubstrPreserved}$ 由下式定义，结构量词为元层类量词。"},{"id":"b576240540ebc13e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\forall\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 由 [[57-df-herbrand-expansion]] 定义。"},{"id":"9ac2726b1083a9db","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 为有限的无量词且无等号公式集；$\\mathrm{EqFree}$ 取 [[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]。$\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{SC}$、$\\mathrm{root}$ 取 [[57-df-fin-deriv-tree]]，$\\mathrm{Sf}$ 取 [[57-df-subformula]]。对 $q=\\Gamma_q\\Rightarrow\\Delta_q$，$\\mathrm{forms}(q)=\\Gamma_q\\cup\\Delta_q$；$\\mathrm{NodeForms}$ 按有限树递归。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-c